475 0 obj
<</Type/Page/Annots[476 0 R 478 0 R 480 0 R]/Contents[482 0 R 483 0 R 484 0 R]/CropBox[0 0 612 792]/Group<</Type/Group/CS/DeviceRGB/S/Transparency>>/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources<</ExtGState<</GS0 485 0 R>>/Font<</C0_0 200 0 R/F0 208 0 R/F1 210 0 R/F2 214 0 R/F3 218 0 R/F5 222 0 R>>/ProcSet[/PDF/Text/ImageB/ImageC/ImageI]/XObject<</Fm0 486 0 R/Fm1 487 0 R/L-a052bbb4-e599-4de5-95f4-d83e52d49af3 235 0 R>>>>/Tabs/S/Parent 2 0 R>>
